 (text "Lidar Ethernet: LAN7800 on Jetson USB2, second RJ45" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 3 3) (thickness 0.5) bold) (justify left)) (uuid "4ef6a8e5-2084-5c2f-9a30-9630f5b2f84c"))
(text "The SICK TiM561 talks 100BASE-TX. The LAN7800 hangs off the module USB2 pair (the Antmicro USB-C/DP port" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 33.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "b4f094b5-e7d8-5d73-a864-19bef928fbeb"))
(text "that the car does not use). Driver: lan78xx, in the stock L4T kernel." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 38.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "f05275ad-3ccc-5e28-8599-1648de269b02"))
(text "No EEPROM: the driver sets the MAC address. VBUS_DET tied to 3.3 V (always attached). TEST to GND." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 43.18000000000001 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "81d58651-28be-597f-92c2-e2ba3eeb1a93"))
(text "Internal 1.2 V switcher: 3.3 uH + 10 uF. Internal 2.5 V LDO feeds the PHY. Voltage-mode PHY: the jack PHY-side" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 48.260000000000005 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "9212cc36-4cff-50f2-b389-2072948100e1"))
(text "centre taps only get the 10 nF cap. Cable-side centre taps: Bob Smith (75 Ohm, 1 nF 2 kV)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 53.34 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "0f806b01-9ebb-59e2-8695-c3957a2c545b"))
(text "Crystal 25 MHz, 18 pF load: 27 pF caps (2 x (18 - 4.5 pF stray))." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 58.42 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "7fe9ce13-9a85-5f86-9a75-feddb55569c4"))
